<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian Feb wholesale prices up 0.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Austrian Feb wholesale prices up 0.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN WHOLESALE PRICES   Feb 97   Jan 97     Feb 96</p>
<p> Monthly WPI index rise	 +0.1	+0.4	+0.4</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr WPI index rise	+0.7	+0.9	-0.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1986)	     100.5     100.4	104.3</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 27</p>
